  "limitations": [
    "One built-image run on one machine (Windows, Node 22.22.0); the exact-main run is the closure proof. The built-image mutants (BB1 and BB4 rerun and killed at the fix; BB2 and BB3 scratch product faults killed on the pre-fix leaf and not rerun because their named checks are unchanged; BB5 not realizable as specified, no kill credited) were taken at GREEN or at the fix and are not rerun here.",
